USE poketrader;
-- Pokémon TCG Pocket A Series dataset.
-- Promo-A and Deluxe Pack: ex (A4b) are intentionally excluded.
-- Each A-Series expansion is represented as its own set; each themed Pocket booster is represented as a pack within that set.
-- Pocket packs contain five cards; the random sixth shiny card mechanic is intentionally not implemented.
-- Cards may appear in multiple packs within the same set, as represented by multiple contains rows.
-- Shiny and Shiny Super Rare cards remain in their normal pack pull pools.
-- A1 through A2a use the standard rule; A2b through A4a use the shiny-inclusive rule.
-- Pocket rarity mappings: Common->Common, Uncommon->Uncommon, Rare/Double Rare->Holo/Rare, Art Rare/Super Rare/Shiny->Premium Rare, Special Art Rare/Immersive Rare/Shiny Super Rare->Chase Rare, Crown Rare->Ultra-Chase Rare.







